    glossEn: 'On the Mi\u02bfraj, the Prophet \ufdfa was taken to the seventh heaven where he saw Ibrahim (AS) leaning his back against al-Bayt al-Maʿmur — described in reports as standing above the Kaʻbah — entered by 70,000 angels every day who never return to it. Ibrahim’s posture against the Frequented House — the heavenly counterpart of the house he built on earth — is a sign of his eternal proximity to Allah and his lasting guardianship of the house of tawhid.',
